You have traveled back in time to save $FG,12$Terry$FG$ from the aliens and $FG,10$glowies$FG$.

$FG,12$Terry$FG$ is counting on you to help stay fed with $FG,6$BK burgers$FG$ and $FG,8$Diet Shasta$FG$.

Distracted by his lost $FG,5$bird$FG$ he risks not seeing UFOs and getting abducted!


$FG,2$Controls$FG$

  $FG,3$Left / Right$FG$   - Thrust in that direction
  $FG,3$Up / Down$FG$      - Adjust altitude
  $FG,3$Space$FG$          - Fire (also continues on the WAVE CLEAR screen)
  $FG,3$B$FG$              - $FG,6$BK boost$FG$ (destroys all on-screen UFOs)
  $FG,3$S$FG$              - $FG,8$Shasta boost$FG$ (30s faster ship AND $FG,12$Terry$FG$)
  $FG,3$H$FG$              - Hyper-jump to $FG,12$Terry's$FG$ location (once per wave)
  $FG,3$R$FG$              - Restart (on the GAME OVER screen)
  $FG,3$ESC$FG$            - Quit

$FG,2$Mission Briefing:$FG$

  - UFOs swoop down to carry $FG,10$glowies$FG$ to safety in space.

  - Rescued $FG,10$glowies$FG$ turn UFOs into a kamikaze UFOs headed for your ship!

  - $FG,12$Terry$FG$ will handle the $FG,10$glowies$FG$ on the ground with his car!

  - $FG,12$Terry$FG$ also picks up items on the ground for your shared inventory.

  - A wave ends when every UFO and $FG,10$glowie$FG$ is gone (even without the $FG,5$bird$FG$!)

  - If a UFO grabs $FG,12$Terry$FG$, an alert flashes, rescue him or it is $FG,4$GAME OVER!$FG$

  - Once per wave you can hyper-jump to him if he is in trouble.

  - Use $FG,6$BK$FG$, $FG,8$Shasta$FG$, and recover the $FG,5$bird$FG$ for the $FG,12$King Terry Bonus!$FG$

  - Green check marks and a crown track your bonus progress for the wave.

  - When $FG,12$King Terry$FG$ is achieved $FG,12$Terry$FG$ can help kill landed UFOs with his car!

$FG,2$Tips:$FG$

  - Radar at the top tracks the$FG,5$ bird$FG$, bonus items,$FG$ $FG,10$Glowies$FG$, $FG,12$Terry$FG$ and UFOs.

  - Terrified by aliens,$FG$ $FG,10$glowies$FG$, and UFOs $FG,12$Terry's $FG,5$bird$FG$ escapes early each wave.

  - $FG,12$Terry's $FG,5$bird$FG$ appears $FG,5$PURPLE$FG$ on your radar at the top of the sceen.

  - $FG,12$Terry's$FG$ $FG,5$bird$FG$ will try to fly away from you, use a $FG,8$Shasta boost$FG$ to help.

  - $FG,12$Terry's $FG,5$bird$FG$ may escape if $FG,12$Terry$FG$ gets abducted.

  - Hyper-jump followed by $FG,6$BK boost$FG$ is a powerful combo to protect $FG,12$Terry$FG$.

  - Wait to kill all the UFOs until you have the $FG,5$bird$FG$ if going for the bonus.
